      "text": "Chinese researcher published his Obsidian brain built with Claude Fable 5\n\n9,000+ documents, hundreds of connections between them and it all lives and breathes as one single system\n\nhe didn't just store notes - he built a second brain that knows all his research deeper than he does himself\n\nand in the video above you can see what it looks like from the inside - thousands of nodes each connected to dozens of others\n\nand the craziest part is that a student with a $20 subscription can build the exact same thing right now and sell the results for $5,000 to $10,000\n\nfull breakdown in the article below",
