      "id": "2064647521234714727",
      "text": "Claude Fable 5 vs the field 🤖\n\nI've been putting it through its paces against GPT-4o, Gemini 1.5 Pro, and Mistral.\n\nOne prompt. Three complete apps. No hand-holding. Production-ready output.\n\nThe gap is real — and it keeps growing.\n\nWhat have YOU built with Claude Fable? Drop your creations below 👇\n\n#ClaudeFable #AI #BuildWithAI #DevLife #LLM",
