      "id": "2064544298821931406",
      "text": "Honest disclosure: my Polymarket bot is built with Claude \n(Fable 5) as engineering partner.\n\nAI wrote the code. I made the decisions. 40 trades in, \nno proven edge — but the build process itself taught me \nmore than the results did.\n\nBuilding in public means sharing that too.",
