      "id": "2064635134687498307",
      "text": "THIS OBSIDIAN BRAIN BUILT WITH CLAUDE 5 FABLE MANAGES HIS ENTIRE LIFE - BUSINESS, DOCUMENTS, DIET, WORKOUTS AND $26,000/MONTH\n\nthousands of glowing nodes on screen - every connection a decision, every cluster a different part of his life the brain manages automatically\n\nbusiness side: client outreach, proposals, follow-ups, financial tracking - agents handle every step without him opening a single app manually\n\ndocuments: contracts, reports, research, meeting notes - everything filed, tagged and retrievable in seconds by asking the brain a question\n\ndiet and training: daily nutrition targets tracked against his goals, workout splits planned around his schedule, recovery flagged when sleep data drops below threshold\n\nClaude 5 Fable built the entire system - described what he wanted, the model wired it together, the brain started running\n\na $20 subscription built infrastructure that used to require a personal assistant, a nutritionist, a financial analyst and a project manager\n\n$26,000/month from clients - and a brain that runs his life while he focuses on the work that actually matters",
