      "text": "Sunday evening: blank page.\n\nWednesday: full THORWallet website rebuilt.\n\nUpdated brand guidelines, new structure, Apple-grade design system, scroll animations - all shipped in 72 hours.\n\nBuilt with Claude Opus, final touches with Fable 5 the day it dropped.\n\nWhat used to take agencies 3 months now takes 3 days. ⚡",
